44. STALE VALIDATION PROTECTION
If a new revision becomes current while validation is running, the validation run remains historically valid for the revision against which it was executed.
It must not automatically become validation for the newer revision.
Therefore:
Revision 17
 ↓
Validation Run 41
remains distinct from:
Revision 18
 ↓
Validation Run 42

